For \(u=(u_{00},u_{01},u_{10},u_{11})\in\mathcal C_\epsilon\), with \(\mathcal C_\epsilon\) as in Definition~\ref{obj:def:overlap-cone}, define
\[
\phi(u)
=
(u_{00}+u_{01}+u_{10}+u_{11})
\left\{
\frac{u_{11}}{u_{10}+u_{11}}
-
\frac{u_{01}}{u_{00}+u_{01}}
\right\}
\]
when \(u\neq 0\), and set \(\phi(0,0,0,0)=0\).

